WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.848
This is Titled. The easy way to buy a house, a condo, or land in Ontario.

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:09.235
On your own, or together with the people you trust.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.374
Every listing on REALTOR.ca comes in live.

00:00:13.374 --> 00:00:20.301
For each one, Titled shows the price split between your buyers, the expected rent, and the monthly mortgage.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.641
Pick your group.

00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:30.901
Invite up to 49 family members or friends, set each person’s share, and everyone sees exactly what they pay before they commit.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.752
When you’re ready, our registered agent makes the offer and negotiates for you.

00:00:36.752 --> 00:00:38.941
A real estate lawyer checks the title.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.197
Need a mortgage?

00:00:41.197 --> 00:00:47.835
Our licensed mortgage partner compares the big banks, credit unions, and private lenders, for any credit score.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:53.323
On closing day, every buyer goes on the title with their own percentage.

00:00:53.323 --> 00:00:56.234
Live in it, rent it out, or sell your share later.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.930
One flat fee of $999, split between the buyers. Titled. Own it together.
